Admins,
	I found this post earlier and it didn't work on our DS10.  I retried
it and attempted pushing the halt button for a second time and that was the
trick.  
Lee Brewer
1. Make sure the Halt button is in the "out" position (not lit). 
2. Enter the login command: P00>>> login 
3. When the Enter Password: prompt is displayed, press the Halt button (the
button should light up), then press <Return>. 
4. Press the Halt button to the "out" position (not lit). 

The password is now cleared and the console cannot be put into secure mode
unless you set a new password. 



