Several people pointed us in the right direction but one person put it so
clearly and succinctly that I'll just quote him directly:

In case you haven't already gotten a solution, I would first do a "voldisk
rm rsc17".  Then "disklabel -z rzc17" to get rid of the old disklabel, =
then
write a new disklabel "disklabel -wr rzc17"  then add the disk back into
your disk group with voldiskadm.   Hope this helps.

