Dear Tru64 gurus,

Sorry for the late summary, but I solved the problem only now.

The knowledge rules for 5.1A are in WEBES 4.0 SP5 which can be found at 
	http://www.compaq.com/support/svctools/webes/webes-sp.html

After updating WEBES don't forget to manually copy the rules  
	Tru64_Unix_Include_Text01_V51A.KRS 
	Tru64_Unix_RULES_V51A.KRS
from the directory 
 	./WEBES_V40SP5/client_rules/tru64unix
to the directory
	/usr/opt/compaq/svctools/ccat/data
because the updating process doesn't do it (at least in my case).

Hoping this helps
Ciao from Italy

Emanuele


