driven by crontab to run at the same time.   The caa services will have to
be setup to wait a specific time prior to failover.    This will prevent
bouncing.

Has anyone written database caa services to take into consideration an
entire cluster reboot?   Which caa parameters must be adjusted in above
scenario?

